     1491       end.
     1492       run partslib-init-temp-parts-by-factord in this-procedure
     1493         (input p-obj-type
     1494         ,input p-obj-code
     1495         ,input p-artic
     1496         ,input p-prod-type
     1497         ,input p-prod-code
     1498         ,input v-day-end-fact-order
     1499         ,input false
     1500         ) no-error .
